 212:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****                 (+++)Blanking:  to mask external events during a defined  time period a defined tim
 213:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****                 (+++)Windowing, to enable external events only during a defined time period
 214:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****               (++)HAL_HRTIM_DeadTimeConfig(): configures the dead-time insertion
 215:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****                   unit for a HRTIM timer. Allows to generate a couple of
 216:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****                   complementary signals from a single reference waveform,
 217:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****                   with programmable delays between active state.
