1308:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  ===============================================================================
1309:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****               ##### Simple output compare functions #####
1310:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  ===============================================================================
1311:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****     [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
1312:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Configure simple output channel
1313:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Start simple output compare
1314:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Stop simple output compare
1315:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Start simple output compare and enable interrupt
1316:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Stop simple output compare and disable interrupt
1317:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Start simple output compare and enable DMA transfer
1318:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Stop simple output compare and disable DMA transfer
1319:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****        -@- When a HRTIM timer operates in simple output compare mode
1320:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****            the output level is set to a programmable value when a match
1321:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****            is found between the compare register and the counter.
1322:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****            Compare unit 1 is automatically associated to output 1
1323:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****            Compare unit 2 is automatically associated to output 2
1324:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c **** @endverbatim
1325:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   * @{
1326:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   */
