3255:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       -@- When a HRTIM timer operates in simple one pulse mode
3256:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****           the timer counter is started in response to transition detected
