3286:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   * @note When the timer operates in simple one pulse mode:
3287:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *         the timer counter is implicitly started by the reset event,
3288:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *         the reset of the timer counter is triggered by the designated external event
3289:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *         GPIO input is implicitly used as event source,
