6515:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c **** /** @defgroup HRTIM_Exported_Functions_Group10 Interrupts handling
6516:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *  @brief  Functions called when HRTIM generates an interrupt
6517:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *          7 interrupts can be generated by the master timer:
6518:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Master timer registers update
6519:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Synchronization event received
6520:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Master timer repetition event
6521:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Master Compare 1 to 4 event
6522:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *          14 interrupts can be generated by each timing unit:
6523:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Delayed protection triggered
6524:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Counter reset or roll-over event
6525:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Output 1 and output 2 reset (transition active to inactive)
6526:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Output 1 and output 2 set (transition inactive to active)
6527:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Capture 1 and 2 events
6528:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Timing unit registers update
6529:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Repetition event
6530:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Compare 1 to 4 event
6531:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *          8 global interrupts are generated for the whole HRTIM:
6532:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - System fault and Fault 1 to 5 (regardless of the timing unit attribution)
6533:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - DLL calibration done
6534:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  *            - Burst mode period completed
